            "modified": "2026-11-04T14:59:51.172Z",
            "name": "Analytic 2293",
            "description": "An analyst observes an AI application retrieve or ingest lower-trust content containing instructions that attempt to redirect the application's behavior. Within the same agent execution context, the AI system subsequently attempts a tool invocation, resource access, or workflow transition outside the actions authorized for the original task or retrieved resource. The analyst correlates content provenance, instruction evidence, subsequent operation, and authorization context to identify potential promotion of untrusted content into operational authority.",
